      "location": "Cornerstone Church",
      "description": "Dinner and childcare are provided!\n\nAre you tired of the cycle of yelling, power struggles, bedtime and sibling battles? Do you sometimes find yourself losing your own calm when your child’s emotions get too big?\n\nPsalms 127:4 tells us, “Like arrows in the hands of warrior are children born in one’s youth.” As parents and caregivers, we have the privilege to guide, strengthen, and prepare our children to become all that God has created them to be.\n\nJoin us for a transformative 8-week parenting series that bridges brain science, relationship building, and Biblical stewardship. This series combines the principles of Circle of Security with the practical tools of Calm Connected Parenting to help you better understand what your child needs when they are struggling. The last 4 weeks will also include a Live Play Lab—a hands-on space to practice learned skills and build confidence with support and coaching. Together building the tools needed to begin sharpening your arrows with greater intention, while keeping your family firmly anchored in the patient, unconditional love of Christ.\n\nWe hope you join us!",
